Package: AUKtest
Title: Calculate the AUK Estimator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Nikos", "Papantonis", email = "feipapantonis@yahoo.gr", 
        role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Georgios", "Afendras", role = "aut"),
    person("Marianthi", "Markatou", role = "aut")
    )
Description: Computes the Area Under the Kendall (AUK) estimator for 
    multivariate independence. The AUK estimator is based on the 
    survival copula and quantifies the deviation from the null 
    hypothesis of independence. The methodology implemented in this 
    package is based on the work of 'Afendras', 'Markatou', and 'Papantonis' 
    (2025) <doi:10.1016/j.jmva.2025.105589>.
